      "content": "thanks for that. i think i might have a couple of errors in my notes though. for 'talossa', is the root actually 'talo'? and for 'kirjan', i thought the root was 'kirja' (book), not 'kiri'. could you double check those and explain the morphophonemics for the 'kirja' to 'kirjan' transition specifically? i'm trying to understand how the stem changes.",
